From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 21:07:49 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] msxml3: Apply parser selection and DTD/schema validation
 during loading.

NewParser selects the newer SAX path and its native errors. ValidateOnParse
actually rejects invalid DTD or cached-XSD instances; manual validation
reports the datatype error and failed loads leave no document element.
Keep locator references and element end positions for validation errors.

Implement deferred XSD compilation and schema cache validation according
to validateOnLoad, release owned schema documents, and attach copied DTDs
to their document. ResolveExternals drives external general entity reads
rather than merely storing an unrelated boolean. Keep DOM error-location
behaviour private to the DOM adapter, preserving public SAX callbacks.

No-error line/column getters return S_FALSE. Native parser/cache tests,
the full Wine DOM/schema/SAX suites and real Office saves pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

